  dialogue:
  - '"Is there a reason why you like comics so much...?"'
  - "I don\u2019t really know. Maybe it\u2019s because I enjoy seeing how the characters
    go through things, make decisions\u2026\r\nI read a lot of things with mysteries
    and investigations, which I think are more interesting."
  - "But there\u2019s no real reason, I guess. I just feel entertained while reading
    them, and that\u2019s what matters most, right?\r"
